      "status": "contextual_provisional",
      "human_reviewed": false,
      "model": null,
      "interpretation_note": "原文以「子建」稱名；卷八「高帝八男」父子名單支持劉姓。",
      "surname_basis": {
        "kind": "contextual_surname_from_cross_chapter_paternal_path",
        "status": "contextual_provisional",
        "human_reviewed": false,
        "rationale": "卷九只保存人物諡號或名；卷八以高帝八男名單明載父子對應，並可回連卷八高祖全名「劉季」。僅沿逐代來源父系記姓，不以家族ID推論。",
